{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55748","headline":"劝人 十二 · 义存","name":"劝人 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见（《祖堂集》卷七「不见」二字作「觅」）路边华表柱，天下忙忙总一般。\n琵琶柦棙（《祖堂集》作「拗捩」）随手转，广陵妙曲无人弹。\n若有人能解弹得，一弹弹尽天下曲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"义存","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}